{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中聯辦早上舉行國慶日升旗儀式。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">儀式早上約七時在中聯辦辦公大樓前舉行，五星紅旗在國歌聲中徐徐升起。中聯辦主任周霽、副主任羅永綱等與工作人員出席，肅立並向國旗行注目禮致敬。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG.LIAISON-0730_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026nipn7xoe7B1790810973.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG.LIAISON-0730_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T23:59:55.548696+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}